      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the market, ideally situated within the highly sought-after Northwood development. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive home offers bright, spacious accommodation and is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area with direct access to a private balcony, and a fully fitted kitchen complete with integrated appliances. There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, including a spacious primary bedroom with fitted wardrobes and an en-suite bathroom, together with a modern family bathroom. The property further benefits from a designated underground parking space, ample storage and a B3 BER, making it both comfortable and energy efficient.\r\n\r\nNorthwood is one of North Dublin's most desirable residential developments, renowned for its beautifully maintained communal grounds and exceptional convenience. Residents enjoy an excellent range of amenities on their doorstep, including a supermarket, cafés, restaurants, bars, Ben Dunne Fitness Centre, Gourmet Food Parlour and the Crowne Plaza Hotel.\r\n\r\nThe location also offers outstanding connectivity, with Dublin City University, Beaumont Hospital, Omni Park Shopping Centre, Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways all within easy reach. Dublin City Centre is approximately a 15-minute drive via the Port Tunnel, while excellent public transport links provide convenient access throughout the city.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a superb location and excellent presentation, this outstanding apartment is ready for immediate occupation and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nService charges are c.€2,283.74/annum.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, furniture, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Furniture shown is for representation purposes only; please consult the estate agent to confirm what will remain in the property.\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nNote:\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only. Property Reference :SBUT2477"
      },
      {
