        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room 4.4m x 5.0m\r\nKitchen 1.8m x 3.1m\r\nBalcony (excluded) 1.3m x 3.1m\r\nHall 3.1m x 3.0m\r\nBathroom 1.8m x 2.0m\r\nBedroom 3.2m x 2.3m\r\nMaster Bedroom 4.5m x 3.9m\r\nEn-Suite 1.8m x 2.8m\r\n\r\nTotal 68 Sqm - 731.946 Sqft."
